: \nL195: EZMix N-Z-Amine^{®} A has been used as a nutritional source in microbial media and plant cell suspension cultures.\nL196: \nL197: EZMix N-Z-Amine^{®} A is suitable for use as a nutritional source in microbial media.\nL198: \nL199: ### Features and Benefits\nL200: \nL201: NZ Amine EZMix powder provides:\nL202: \nL203:   * Granulated, dust-free format for safer handling and faster mixing\nL204:   * Easy scale-up using larger package sizes\nL205: \nL206: ### Legal Information\nL207: \nL208: N-Z-Amine is a registered trademark of Kerry Group\nL209: \nL210: * * *\nL211: ## Compare Similar Items\nL212: \nL213: 【15†View Full Comparison】\nL214: \nL215: * * *\nL216: \nL217: Show Differences\nL218: \nL219: [Input]\nL220: \nL221: 1 of 1\nL222: ###### This Item\nL223:  | T2559  | N4517  | C7290\nL224: --- | --- | --- | ---\nL225: 【16†Sigma-Aldrich C4464 EZMix N-Z-Amine^{®} A】[Button: Quick View]  | 【17†Sigma-Aldrich T2559 EZMix Tryptone】[Button: Quick View]  | 【18†Millipore N4517 N-Z-Amine^{®} AS Casein Peptone】[Button: Quick View]  | 【19†Sigma-Aldrich C7290 N-Z-Amine^{®} A】[Button: Quick View]\nL226: description Casein enzymatic hydrolysate, from bovine milk  | description Pancreatic digest of casein  | description Enzymatically Digested  | description suitable for plant cell culture\nL227: suitability nonselective for coliforms, nonselective for Escherichia coli  | suitability nonselective for coliforms, nonselective for Escherichia coli  | suitability-  | suitability-\nL228: application(s)agriculture\nL229: (ffff^{123})  | application(s)-  | application(s)microbiology  | application(s)agriculture\nL230: form powder  | form powder  | form powder  | form powder\nL231: sterility non-sterile  | sterility non-sterile  | sterility-  | sterility-\nL232: biological source bovine milk  | biological source-  | biological source bovine milk  | biological source-\nL233: storage temp.room temp  | storage temp.room temp  | storage temp.-  | storage temp.-\nL234: * * *\nL235: ## 